<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's FCL Energy settles legal dispute with JFP.</title>
<headline>NZ's FCL Energy settles legal dispute with JFP.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's Fletcher Challenge Energy said on Wednesday that legal proceedings against it by JFP Energy Inc had been settled on mutually agreed terms.</p>
<p>Fletcher did not disclose the terms but said: &quot;The settlement will not have any significant effect on the financial results of Fletcher Challenge Energy for the current financial year.&quot;</p>
</text>
